/ C8 (nbrs: C4 C5 C9 C12 C13)
               LAC
               SUM C4
               SUM C5
               SUM C9
               SUM C12
               SUM C13
               CAC IAC
               SUM K_3
               SAC
               VEA g2c8_chk2
               VEA g2c8_one
g2c8_chk2,     CAC IAC
               IAC
               SAC
               VEA g2c8_zero
               LAC
               SUM C8
               SAC
               VEA g2c8_one
g2c8_zero,     LAC
               VEA g2c8_store
g2c8_one,      LAC
               IAC
g2c8_store,    DEL N8
